  m_Name: VY_Coworker
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSO
  startingNodeID: Intro0
  nodes:
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Intro0
    nextNodeID: Intro1
    text: 'Hello, rookie. '
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: ???
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Intro1
    nextNodeID: Intro2
    text: I am the master of the messengers of borning vineyard, though the title
      is onerous to me.
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Carpus
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Intro2
    nextNodeID: Intro3
    text: Carpus is my name. I know you will be the newest member of our company.
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 0
    speakerName: Carpus
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Intro3
    nextNodeID: Quest0
    text: Come in, and I will tell you your tasks for the day.
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 0
    speakerName: Carpus
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Quest0
    nextNodeID: Quest1
    text: 'You have four tasks on hand. First, Three farmers have entrusted us with
      their produce: '
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 0
    speakerName: Carpus
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Quest1
    nextNodeID: Quest2
    text: Lydos, who farms wheat, Trophimus, who owns an olive grove, and Damasos,
      who grows figs.
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 0
    speakerName: Carpus
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Quest2
    nextNodeID: Quest3
    text: You are to retrieve the food from each of them and bring it back here to
      ship further on to Athens. They all need the coin, so be swift.
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 0
    speakerName: Carpus
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Quest3
    nextNodeID: Quest4
    text: 'Next, bring back the wine kept safe in the Dionysus temple located north
      west of vineyard.  '
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 0
    speakerName: Carpus
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Quest4
    nextNodeID: choices0
    text: 'This one especially shall be executed swiftly and secretively.  '
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Carpus
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: choices0
    nextNodeID: 
    text: ' '
    choices:
    - text: Why is it so needed?
      nextNodeID: Warning
      outcome:
        flagsToSet: []
        statChanges: 
        questsID: []
    - text: Why are there so many tasks on the first day?
      nextNodeID: Warning
      outcome:
        flagsToSet: []
        statChanges: 
        questsID: []
    - text: 'Why is that so I have to be so careful? '
      nextNodeID: Warning
      outcome:
        flagsToSet: []
        statChanges: 
        questsID: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Ceryx
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Warning
    nextNodeID: Purpose0
    text: 'You''re not hired to ask questions. Just do what you''re told to. You
      are not allowed to disclose the grand purpose of Master Cranaus. '
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Carpus
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Purpose0
    nextNodeID: Purpose1
    text: 'And of course, the contract stands firm while Master Cranaus aims to expand
      the business. '
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 0
    speakerName: Carpus
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Purpose1
    nextNodeID: Infertile?
    text: People are desperate to sell their crops after the flood left the land
      infertile. A good deal for us.
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Carpus
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Infertile?
    nextNodeID: History0
    text: The land is infertile?
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Ceryx
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: History0
    nextNodeID: History1
    text: Here is a farming village, but the anger of Poseidon who rules the salt
      sea has made life hard for the people who work this land.
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Carpus
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: History1
    nextNodeID: History2
    text: When the great city of Athens was founded, the earth-shaker fought with
      Athena for the right to give patronage to the great city.
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 0
    speakerName: Carpus
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: History2
    nextNodeID: History3
    text: Athena won the contest, but in his bitter defeat, Poseidon planted his
      trident on the rocks and called up the roaring sea to flood the lands surrounding
      Athens.
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 0
    speakerName: Carpus
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: History3
    nextNodeID: Empathy
    text: Although the waters receded and the earth was baked dry by the fire of
      purifying Helios, the crops remain weak because of the salt the flood left
      in its wake.
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Carpus
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Empathy
    nextNodeID: Fate0
    text: "It seems like it caused terrible suffering\u2026"
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Ceryx
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Fate0
    nextNodeID: Fate1
    text: Everyone is subject to the will of the gods. Our power to change our own
      lives cannot compare to their power over us.
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Carpus
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 1
    id: Fate1
    nextNodeID: 
    text: The people here live under their will, and do not fight against it. You
      should do the same.
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Carpus
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  toggleFlagOnTalk: 1
  flag: met_Coworker
